Dispatch slot: allocated to origin availability (step28), after execute origin dispatch (step30) it becomes available. Allocated to destination availability (step32), after execute destination dispatch (step34) becomes available. Allocated to shift_candidate_alpha (step43), after execute schedule dispatch (step45) becomes available. Allocated to shift_candidate_beta (step56), after execute schedule dispatch (step58) becomes available.

Thus all resources properly managed.

Now we need to ensure that the preconditions for each action are satisfied at the point we call them.

Let's verify each step.

We'll need to track state.

Initial state:

- vehicle_available: alpha, beta, gamma.
- route_task_profile_available: route_task_profile_alpha.
- operator_available: driver_operator_alpha.
- cargo_available: cargo_payload_alpha (not used).
- origin_availability_node_linked: origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha.
- destination_availability_node_linked: destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha.
- transport_leg_available: transport_leg_alpha.
- loading_container_available: loading_container_alpha, loading_container_beta (not used).
- candidate_origin_availability_linked: shift_candidate_alpha origin_availability_alpha; shift_candidate_beta origin_availability_alpha.
- candidate_destination_availability_linked: shift_candidate_alpha destination_availability_alpha; shift_candidate_beta destination_availability_alpha.
- candidate_transport_leg_linked: shift_candidate_alpha transport_leg_alpha; shift_candidate_beta transport_leg_alpha.
- candidate_loading_container_linked: shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha; shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta.
- equipment_available: equipment_resource_alpha, equipment_resource_beta (not used).
- service_window_available: service_window_alpha, service_window_beta (not used).
- dispatch_slot_available: dispatch_slot_alpha.
- skill_certificate_available: skill_certificate_alpha (not used).
- operational_constraint_available: operational_constraint_alpha, operational_constraint_beta.
- candidate_operational_constraint_linked: shift_candidate_alpha operational_constraint_alpha; shift_candidate_beta operational_constraint_beta.
- compliance_certificate_available: compliance_certificate_alpha.

No candidate_created, no vehicle_allocated, no candidate_task_profile_linked, no candidate_operator_linked, no candidate_prepared, etc.

Now step1: create_candidate origin_availability_alpha.

Precondition: not candidate_created, not dispatched. Both false. Effect: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha.

Step2: create_candidate destination_availability_alpha. Same.

Step3: create_candidate shift_candidate_alpha.

Step4: create_candidate shift_candidate_beta.

Now state: all four have candidate_created true.

Step5: allocate_vehicle_unit origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha.

Precondition: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha (true), not vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha (true). Effect: vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha true, candidate_vehicle_linked origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha true, vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha false.

Step6: attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha.

Precondition: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha (true), route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha (true). Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha true, route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha false.

Step7: confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha.

Precondition: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), not candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true). Effect: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha true.

Step8: assign_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha.

Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true), operator_available driver_operator_alpha (true). Effect: candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha true, operator_available driver_operator_alpha false.

Step9: activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha.

Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true), not origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha (true), not origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha (true). Effect: origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha true.

Step10: lock_origin_availability origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha.

Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha (true), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true), origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha (true), not origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha (true). Effect: origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha true, origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha true.

Step11: release_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha.

Precondition: candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha (true). Effect: operator_available driver_operator_alpha true, not candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha.

Now after step11, operator available again.

Step12: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate origin_availability_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha.

Precondition: dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha (need to be true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha (true), not dispatch_allocated origin_availability_alpha (true).

But we have not set dispatch_ready for origin_availability_alpha yet. Indeed we have not done mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready. So dispatch_ready is false. So precondition fails.

Thus we need to make origin_availability_alpha dispatch_ready before allocating dispatch slot.

We have not yet assembled transport leg or authorized loading. So we need to do those steps before we can allocate dispatch slot for origin.

Thus we need to lock both origin and destination, then assemble transport leg, authorize loading, then mark origin dispatch ready, then allocate dispatch slot, etc.

Thus we need to process destination availability similarly before we can assemble leg.

Thus we need to continue with destination steps before we can do assemble, authorize, mark dispatch ready, allocate slot, execute.

Thus we need to delay origin dispatch until after we have both locked and transport leg ready.

Thus we should not allocate dispatch slot for origin until after we have mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready.

Thus we need to reorder: after locking both origin and destination, we assemble transport leg, authorize loading, then mark origin dispatch ready, allocate dispatch slot for origin, execute origin dispatch, then mark destination dispatch ready, allocate dispatch slot for destination, execute destination dispatch.

Thus we need to keep the task profile linked for origin and destination until after we allocate dispatch slot.

Thus we should not detach task profile before allocate dispatch slot. We'll detach after allocate dispatch slot but before execute dispatch (as earlier). Good.

Thus we need to keep the candidate_task_profile_linked for origin and destination until after allocate_dispatch_slot.

Thus we need to postpone detach until after allocate_dispatch_slot.

Thus we need to not detach after lock; we keep it.

Thus after lock we release operator, but keep task profile linked.

Thus after locking both origin and destination, we have:

- origin_availability_alpha: candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, candidate_task_profile_linked, candidate_prepared, candidate_operator_linked? No, we released operator after lock, so candidate_operator_linked false. But we still have candidate_task_profile_linked true, candidate_prepared true, origin_availability_locked true, origin_availability_confirmed true, origin_node_ready true.

- destination_availability_alpha: similarly.

Now we need to assemble transport leg.

Step25: assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha.

Precondition: origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha (true), destination_availability_locked destination_availability_alpha (true), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true), destination_availability_node_linked destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha (true), origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha (true), destination_node_ready destination_node_alpha (true), origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha (true), destination_availability_confirmed destination_availability_alpha (true), transport_leg_available transport_leg_alpha (true). Effect: transport_leg_assembled transport_leg_alpha true, transport_leg_origin_linked transport_leg_alpha origin_node_alpha true, transport_leg_destination_linked transport_leg_alpha destination_node_alpha true, not transport_leg_available transport_leg_alpha false.

Step26: authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha.

Precondition: transport_leg_assembled transport_leg_alpha (true), origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), not transport_leg_loading_authorized transport_leg_alpha (true). Effect: transport_leg_loading_authorized transport_leg_alpha true.

Now we can mark origin dispatch ready.

Step27: mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha transport_leg_alpha.

Precondition: origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha (true), origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha (true), transport_leg_assembled transport_leg_alpha (true), transport_leg_loading_authorized transport_leg_alpha (true